lpha.81 · build dc81296d0677\ndc81296d06774217c2100830c8caca1ff604c4b7\n\nServer setup\n\nTR\nEN\nLA\nlabadmin\nPrepare your server\n\nFollow the setup steps and their recorded results here.\n\nSetup is waiting for a requirement\nVerify public DNS before certificate issuance: panel-debian13.upd1-infra.test\n\nCertificate issuance requires this public A record: panel-debian13.upd1-infra.test → 192.0.2.10.\n\nThe public record has not been verified yet. This result alone does not establish whether the record is absent or a DNS server is unreachable.\n\nCreate or correct this record at the DNS provider or primary that manages it. You do not need to create a website in Domains.\n\nThis prerequisite is checked automatically. After it passes, the same setup continues. To change the reviewed names or addresses, use Edit plan below.\n\nEdit plan\nChecks and how to continue\n\nThe required public DNS record has not been verified. Follow the record and DNS management instructions above; certificate requests wait for this check.\n\nTechnical details\nThe Panel restarts once during this setup\n\nAt the step “Secure panel access: panel-debian13.upd1-infra.test”, the Panel gets its certificate and restarts once to start using it. This page then loses its connection for a short time. That is planned: setup continues on the server and this page reconnects by itself. You do not need to do anything.\n\nOnce that step has finished, the Panel can also be opened at its secure address: https://panel-debian13.upd1-infra.test:2083\n\nYou sign in again there, and setup shows the same progress. If the browser warns about the certificate at that address, the step has not finished yet, and this page keeps following setup by itself.\n\nConfigure DNS: Use an external DNS provider\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare component: Nginx\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare component: PHP-FPM\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare component: MariaDB\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare mail profile: Webmail\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare mail profile: Spam-Protected Mail\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare component: Scheduled tasks (cron)\n\nCompleted\n\nPrepare component: Certbot\n\nCompleted\n\nApply and save the firewall policy\n\nCompleted\n\nVerify public DNS before certificate issuance: panel-debian13.upd1-infra.test\n\n192.0.2.10\n\nIn progress\n\nSecure panel access: panel-debian13.upd1-infra.tes"}}
